# Workspace commerce config (P5-C — optional)

Config layer for **one payment model per workspace** before live PSP wiring. **Not required for Denali customer v1.**

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** `TEMP/p5/p5-c-workspace-commerce-config.md` (historical local scratch `p5-c-workspace-commerce-config.md`; not fresh-clone authority — see docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-2b-temp-authority-inventory.yaml) v2.9

**Status (2026-06-22):** P5-C complete (N-001..010) · current nano P5-D-N-001 (optional integrations)

**Prerequisite:** P5-core exit (`P5-B-N-016`) — Denali operator parity on metadata path complete.

---

## Executive summary

| Layer | P5-C delivers |
|-------|----------------|
| **Schema** | `WorkspaceCommerceConfig` — payment mode + optional gateway provider |
| **Persistence** | Commerce block on workspace definition publish + tenant binding inherit |
| **Tour default** | Non-Denali tour create sets `pricing.paymentMode` from workspace default |
| **UI** | Super Admin commerce badge hidden/read-only for `workspaceType=denali` |
| **Preservation** | PC-07 — Denali stays `offline_receipt`; receipt routes unchanged |

