## Denali scope (frozen — P5-C-N-001 DOC-C-01)

Denali is **excluded** from commerce configuration UI and gateway wiring in P5-C v1.

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Payment mode | **`offline_receipt` only** — no Super Admin toggle |
| Flow | Member upload → admin review (existing finance routes) |
| P5-C UI | Commerce badge **hidden or read-only** for `workspaceType=denali` |
| Preservation | **PC-07** — tour canonical `pricing.paymentMode` stays `offline_receipt` |

Cross-ref: [`platform-denali-operator-parity.mdoc`](./platform-denali-operator-parity.mdoc) PC-07 · `TEMP/p5/PRESERVATION-CHECKLIST.md` (historical local scratch `PRESERVATION-CHECKLIST.md`; not fresh-clone authority — see docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-2b-temp-authority-inventory.yaml).

```text
STOP (Denali S0):
  - No gatewayProvider on Denali tenants
  - No Super Admin payment-mode toggle for workspaceType=denali
  - PC-07 + receipt route specs must stay green after every P5-C nano
