## Data flow (non-Denali)

```text
Super Admin publishes workspace definition
  → mergeCommerceIntoWorkspaceDefinitionPayload (default offline_receipt when absent)
  → payload.commerce validated (SCH-01..03)
  → checksum includes commerce block (N-003)

Tenant binding set
  → tour create reads workspace commerce default (N-004..005)
  → pricing.paymentMode written on canonical ingress

Denali tenant
  → skip commerce UI (N-006)
  → pricing.paymentMode forced offline_receipt (API-04, PC-07)
```

---

## Persistence on publish (frozen — P5-C-N-003)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/workspace-metadata/persist-commerce-on-publish.ts`

| Step | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| 1 | Incoming publish body may omit `payload.commerce` |
| 2 | `mergeCommerceIntoWorkspaceDefinitionPayload` injects `DEFAULT_WORKSPACE_COMMERCE_CONFIG` |
| 3 | `validateWorkspaceDefinitionPayload` accepts optional `commerce` and validates shape |
| 4 | `computeWorkspaceDefinitionPayloadChecksum` hashes the merged payload (commerce included) |

Wired in `publishPlatformWorkspaceDefinitionVersion` **before** validation — stored version rows always carry an explicit commerce block after P5-C-N-003.

---

## Tenant binding inherit (frozen — P5-C-N-004)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/workspace-metadata/resolve-workspace-commerce-for-tenant.ts`

| Step | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| 1 | `parseDefinitionPayload` merges default commerce when DB row predates N-003 |
| 2 | `resolveWorkspaceCommerceConfigForTenant` reads `payload.commerce` when metadata flag + binding set |
| 3 | Package path (no binding) → `DEFAULT_WORKSPACE_COMMERCE_CONFIG` |
| 4 | `workspaceType=denali` → always `{ paymentMode: offline_receipt, gatewayProvider: null }` (PC-07 / API-04) |
| 5 | Platform row missing → `readTenantWorkspaceMetadataBinding` falls back to static dev registry (no metadata binding) so memory-path `createTour` specs resolve commerce without Postgres |

---

## Tour create default (frozen — P5-C-N-005)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/tours/apply-workspace-commerce-create-default.ts` · wired in `tours.service.ts` `createTour`.

`ToursService` accepts optional `resolveCommerce` dep (tests only) to inject commerce without platform DB.

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| API-03 | Non-Denali create merges missing `pricing.paymentMode` from resolved workspace commerce; when `pricing` is injected, `roots` gains `pricing` if absent (canonical ROOT_UNKNOWN guard) |
| API-04 | Denali create forces `offline_receipt` even when client omits or sends another mode |

