## Super Admin commerce badge (frozen — P5-C-N-006)

Implementation: `apps/web/src/platform/club-commerce-badge.tsx` · rendered on workspace tab.

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| UI-02 | `workspaceType=denali` → read-only `offline_receipt` badge; gateway controls hidden (`data-commerce-gateway-ui="hidden"`) |
| UI-02b | Non-Denali clubs show commerce badge with resolved `paymentMode` (+ provider label when gateway) |
| UI-02c | Tenant detail DTO exposes `workspaceCommerce` from `resolveWorkspaceCommerceConfigForTenantById` |

Implementation detail: `GET /platform/v1/tenants/:id` includes `workspaceCommerce`; workspace tab passes it to `ClubCommerceBadge`.

